      "countAsQuest:1": 1,
      "desc:8": "LuV is where GregGuns leaves the plain Assembler behind. The Nether Blaster is built on the Assembly Line, with a research item scanned first, just like GT\u0027s own LuV parts. The Alien Blaster, the Grim Reaper and the Golden Gun are LuV Assembler builds, but they all want HSS-G plates and LuV parts.\n\nHSS-G is the gate material, so the first job is a good supply of HSS-G plates and LuV circuits. Energy guns at this tier are tier 6 electric items: they take a Lapotronic Orb II as their battery, come out uncharged, and only charge in a LuV charger or battery buffer.\n\nAssembly Line recipes need a scanned research item and fluids such as soldering alloy, lubricant or lava, and a scanned weapon is matched whatever its charge or wear. Keep a spare of the weapon one tier below the one you want to build.\n\n[note]Press R over any item in NEI for the exact recipe. Quests only check what you carry and never take it.[/note]",
